Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《讹诈专家》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,{\blur3}(巴黎)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最亲爱的埃米尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Emile my dearest one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[法语]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最亲爱的埃米尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dearest Emile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫已经改变了计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my husband has changed his plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有其他的方式说再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no other way to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我记在你的心中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember me in your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}12年后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}12 Years Later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁在巴黎出卖了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who betrayed me in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你等这么久才来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and why did you wait so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现你的贵妇风范令人吃惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find your ladyship's attitude surprising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以上问题的答案与你无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The answers to those questions are no concern of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我乞求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On my knees I beg you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发发慈悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I employ you to show mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不管什么慈悲 夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not in the business of mercy Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使我愿意给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if I wished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么能让我丈夫不发现呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how could I without my husband knowing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连尝试都不去做… 这种建议…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh you'd be exceedingly ill advised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个馊主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to make an effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悉听尊便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do your worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你别想从我这里得到一个子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not have a penny from me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的孙子们已经受到了足够的惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My grandsons were punished enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很少收到他们的来信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear from them only seldom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们是不想让我伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They wish to spare me their misery I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个魔鬼已经归西了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This monster who brought about their downfall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还健在 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He lives and breathes Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面带笑容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a smiling face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但内心冷酷无情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a heart of marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该早点来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should have come to me sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果能早点认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only I'd known of you sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的一个朋友把你介绍给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A friend gave me your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对你的评价很高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has a high regard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就因为你的正义感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your sense of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你读诗吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you read poetry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}试试这页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try a leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C.A.M.魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}CAM devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我能给你的唯一线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the only clue I can offer you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe it will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是为了自己 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish nothing for myself Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那已经太晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is too late for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只希望…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish only{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能拯救他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to save others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}3:45去伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}3:45 for London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里我觉得很悲哀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt great sadness there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想到那个屋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To think that that house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回荡着孩子们成长的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must have reverberated to the sounds of those boys growing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个掠夺弱者的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man who preys upon weakness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面带微笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a smiling face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但冷酷无情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a heart of marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个讹诈专家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A master blackmailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听过人们对他的私语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard whisper of him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是没人知道他的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet no one has put a name to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从没人提及过讹诈之事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well there's no mention of blackmail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使报纸的专栏也没有捕风捉影过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even a whisper of a newspaper column.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有记录吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have reported it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于她的两个孙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of her two grandchildren,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大哥乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}George the elder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和维克·克罗夫特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Vike Kroft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被人捉奸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was caught in a moment of indiscretion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸上说是美人计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}referred to the paper as the Badger Game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像是说这位绅士被妓女勾引上床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to involve a gentleman being lured to the bed of a prostitute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then being discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}捉奸在床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}'In flagrante delicto' by a third party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像往常一样 这些耸人听闻的报道又弄错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As usual the sensational press has got it wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位女士确实是位演员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lady was an actress that is true{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不是被逮个正着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it was no [unintelligible]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他结婚了 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was married Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}入赘的是全国最有影响力的家族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into one of the highest family's in the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸上大肆报道了一番{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The paper's made plenty of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小一点的呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the younger boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Edward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为他哥哥报仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, he revenged for his brother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用左轮枪打了男仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}took a revolver to the footman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仆人叫… 维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who's name was, uh Veitch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当面开的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}burst in upon him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}子弹打到了脸上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shot him in the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这人还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man lived{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但已经毁容了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but was disfigured for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}审判结束后 他就失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After the trial he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须找到维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is Veitch we must find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他能带我们找到猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to lead us to our prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 你不舒服吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Hudson are you not well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I'm well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我讨厌卷心菜的味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then please you know I hate the smell of cabbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}兄弟俩肯定受了很多折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely the brothers would know they're tormenter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哥哥很丢脸地离开了英国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The older brother fled the country in disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华服刑之后也去找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Edward joined him having served his sentence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们现在在法国某个地方过着富裕的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they're now living richly somewhere in France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一个很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C.A.M魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C.A.M Devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是愿意 读读吧 找点线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Read it for clues if you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我更愿意读海内森的诗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I rather liked Henneson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后再读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你集中精力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd prefer you to direct your energies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看闲话作家那段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}towards the gossip columnists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}草原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Grasslands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}草原 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Grasslands Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毒蛇生活在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for which our serpent lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我们你要去哪 夏洛特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do tell us where you're going Charlotte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes do tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛蒂你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lottie where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以吗  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I, dearest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that my love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要告诉他们我们去哪度蜜月吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell them where we're going for our honeymoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've no objections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是布迪索特顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Buddley Solterton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太浪漫了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How romantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是很浪漫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is actually very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我就去国外什么地方度蜜月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall have to choose somewhere abroad for a honeymoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴黎或是罗马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Paris or Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许吧 达芙妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may Daphne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是要是命中注定要嫁给一个军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if one's fate is to marry a soldier,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她一生就得漂泊异乡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}abroad may well be one's whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的蜜月呢  伊娃小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your honeymoon Lady Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和哈瑞决定了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you and Harry decided yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}佛罗伦萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Florence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不勒斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naples,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康斯汀坦布尔 我想吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Constantinople I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听上去不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sounds delightful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你让他嫉妒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you've made him envious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛特 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charlotte my dear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得回兵营了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must return to barracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚能见到你吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I see you this evening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 职责所限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, duties forbid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}团里有晚宴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our regimental dinner alas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛蒂 他真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lottie he is gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也很可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's divine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么有这福气找到夏洛特呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How'd you get so lucky Charlotte?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是布迪索特顿在哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But where is Buddley Solterton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真为你高兴 洛蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh I'm so happy for you Lottie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是出自我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear Colonel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会想我把原件给你看吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you don't expect me to give you the original do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从哪得到的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁给你的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who gave it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了你心爱之人还有谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who but the object of your affections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想从我这儿得到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 1200磅 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Two hundred pounds! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么点就能搞定一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For it all to be blown away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做梦 一分钱我都不给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never! I won't part with a penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要先看着你下地狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll see you in hell first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想你可爱的新娘 上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think of your lovely bride Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:13:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个人都要问问自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One has to ask oneself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能吃多少黄油？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how much butter can one eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多帝马丁很明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dotty Martian apparently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能吃17勺盐外加一些胡椒粉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}got seventeen salt and pepper parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}17勺？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seventeen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想到了一个解决的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was thinking of a way of dealing with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 就是… - 帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- was to... - Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给她写封礼貌的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was to mail her politely,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直都挺有用 直到再也没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}always useful until the awful day when always useless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就告诉了公爵夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she said to the Duchess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不是吧 - 是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. - Yes, it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利利无意中听到的 是吧利利？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lillie overheard her didn't you Lillie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈瑞想在海上举行婚礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Harry wanted us to be married at sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一艘私人游船上 只有船员参加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on a pirate ship with only the crew invited{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是谁也不能这样 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but one really can't can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 没人真能那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No my dear one really can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我下了一个极愚蠢的赌注{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made an extremely foolish wager{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果最后我和一个重骑兵干上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I ended up boxing a dragoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.89,0:15:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这三天里 这场婚礼还有什么要完善的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you mend for the nuptials, my dear fellow, in three days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是有点小小的焦虑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a small flutter in itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给凉脚丫的厚袜子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thick socks for cold feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要希望它们派不上用场都很难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can rarely hopes they won't be needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我祖父幻想自己是个拳击手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah my grandfather fancied himself as something of a pugilist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个魁梧的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a fortho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得有一年夏天在爱尔兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember one summer in Ireland,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我那时大概有8岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must have been about eight years old I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他决定给我上一课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He decided to give me a lesson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没有那么害怕过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never been so frightened in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛蒂 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lottie what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛蒂？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lottie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是信…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's some letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来去不成布迪索特顿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like it's goodbye Buddley Solterton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须去看看她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must go to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别去 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No my angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缪尔王子要迎娶哈甘罗德男爵之女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prince Muir is about to marry Baroness Haganlod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:17:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他第一任妻子玛丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lost his first wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}徳娃葛兰姆公主 在10年前去世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Princess Mary Devagram ten years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗斯伯里阁下受邀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Rosebury has accepted an invitation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将参加在谢菲尔德举行的卡特勒家宴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to dine at the Cutler's Feast in Sheffield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你心不在焉 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not trying Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well really Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直在读报纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been reading things out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自从今早8点开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since half past eight this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有一篇文章让你有反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You haven't reacted to a single article.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall react I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你有东西吸引到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the moment you read out something which catches my attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh this is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰霍克斯坦国王板球队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Hockstein of English Cricketers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下个月要去费城和多伦多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are leaving next monthfor Philadelphia and Toronto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些地方的人究竟对板球了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What on earth does that continent know about cricket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尊贵的迈尔斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The honorable Miss Miles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在婚礼的两天前 解除了与多金上校的婚约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has broken off her engagement to Colonel Dorking two days before the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今年冬天女性最重要的一样打扮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The most important item in a woman's appearance this winter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她的帽子头饰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be her headgear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 我来给您生火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've come to light the fire for you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是现在 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at the moment thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警督？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.06,0:22:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是多金上校的来信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's from Colonel Dorking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁送来的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who delivered it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的勤务兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面是多金上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Colonel Dorking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.38,0:22:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和迈尔斯小姐的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His engagement to the honorable Miss Miles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在昨天取消了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was broken off yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你瞧 我有听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see I was listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Lastrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道他是否在楼上 警督{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know that he's in Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警督？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我为什么来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you know what I'm here for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道 和我说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No prey tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了那封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've come for the letter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在那个信封里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which arrived in that envelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:22:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是被偷出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was stolen from the rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在约翰 多金上校的房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Colonel John Dorking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后到了华生医生手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and delivered into the hands of Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在不到20分钟的时间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not twenty minutes ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在在你手上吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是有送来 但算是"偷"吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delivered, yes but stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是给我的私人信件 雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a postal note to me Lastrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是警方的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's police evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上校已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Colonel is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.59,0:23:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by his own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并没有什么凶杀的嫌疑 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Foul play is not suspected is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么这么肯定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can you be so sure it isn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信上说得很明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because the note made it clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他想自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why should he write to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么还要给你写信？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if he's topping himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认识他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had no knowledge of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh answer my question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者 还是把信给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or better still show me the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它不会告诉你什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will tell you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么在我看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it seems to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然雇了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the point of engaging you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.79,0:24:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一定是改变了主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he must have changed his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.35,0:24:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并用士兵的方式了结了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And took a soldier's way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.54,0:24:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他那么说是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does he mean by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这我们永远不会知道了 警督{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll never know Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.82,0:24:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他已经订婚了呀 该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he was engaged to be married damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.07,0:24:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种事不会是第一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well wouldn't be the first time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不会是最后一件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it won't be the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.98,0:24:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说这是敲诈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it was blackmail you'd say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.61,0:24:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说得好 雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done Lastrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.73,0:24:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别挖苦我了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No need for sarcasm Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟我们差不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your as much in the dark,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.57,0:24:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是毫无头绪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as we are then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.16,0:24:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不知道这个敲诈者是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about who this blackmailer might be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一件事你可以肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can be sure of one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.63,0:24:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多金上校不是他的第一个受害人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Colonel Dorking was not his first victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:25:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不会是最后一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will not be his last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye Lastrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.76,0:25:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你有什么消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will let me know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.29,0:25:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会通知我的吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you hear of anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我犯下了一个弥天大错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made a hideous mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你的出马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need your services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.78,0:25:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唯一可惜的是 他没有说出敲诈者的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only pity is he didn't name the blackmailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.40,0:25:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是和信在一起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This came with the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.09,0:25:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯·奥古斯特·米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles Augustus Milverton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}汉普斯特德区阿普尔托尔斯 画商{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Appledore Towers, Hampstead, Art Dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.74,0:25:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的伪装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Camouflage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.16,0:25:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C-A-M{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C-A-M,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.70,0:25:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C.A.M.{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C.A.M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.19,0:26:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的办案生涯里 我和50个凶手打过交道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had to deal with fifty murderers in my career,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.55,0:26:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但就算是其中最凶残一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the worst of them never gave me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.36,0:26:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没有这位查尔斯·奥古斯特·米尔沃顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this sense of revulsion which that I feel at this moment towards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.62,0:26:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么让我厌恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Charles Augustus Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿的老窝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton's lair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是座堡垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.79,0:26:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出乎你的意料吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you surprised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.39,0:27:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯·奥古斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles Augustus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个外国人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he a foreigner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.01,0:27:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他给自己建了座监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's built his own prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.67,0:27:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个反人类的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a man who loathes the human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.73,0:27:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么样的成长环境会让他变成现在这样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What circumstances might bring him to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.82,0:27:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}孩提时代孤独地被养大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well boy brought up in lonely isolation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.82,0:27:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缺少关爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}starved of affection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.63,0:27:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可能是生活在伦敦的郊区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Probably in one of London's outer suburbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.97,0:27:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}郊区？为什么不是Soho区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Outer, why not Soho{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是莱斯特斯广场那里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or Lesters Square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.72,0:27:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为… 我亲爱的福尔摩斯… 那些个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cause, my dear Holmes, those places{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算恶人们像狼群一样出没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with all there vices team like wolves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.69,0:27:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是有好的风气和人性的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}generosity of spirit and humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.12,0:27:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.81,0:27:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚我要派给你一个任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tonight I have an assignment for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.47,0:28:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿意去走访一间画廊吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you're willing to visit an art gallery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你干什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will you be doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.75,0:28:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你难道不觉得那个尊贵的迈尔斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you think that the honorable Miss Miles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.94,0:28:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更值得一访吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}might be more worth a visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然多金写信给了你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since Dorking wrote to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.59,0:28:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是过去了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is past Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.47,0:28:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在要做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What we must do now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.37,0:28:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是紧紧盯上他的下一个受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is fastened ourselves onto his next victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以这个晚上我要尽可能地去了解米尔沃顿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So this evening I'm to discover all I can about Milverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的名声 他的背景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His reputation. His background.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.86,0:28:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及对他的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how those perceive him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.46,0:28:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要和他谈话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I engage him in conversation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但是小心些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes but with caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生在吃午饭的时候病倒了 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His lordship has taken ill at lunch my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.04,0:28:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕是次中风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is feared he may have suffered a stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.07,0:28:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的查尔斯叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh poor Uncle Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人正在陪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her ladyship is with him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道你回来了他会很高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He should be pleased that you're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴安娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.35,0:30:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能见见他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.17,0:30:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一会儿吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.43,0:30:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有多糟糕？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴内医生不太乐观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor Bainey's not optimistic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他活了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.25,0:30:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也会是瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he'll be paralyzed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃 今天晚上 我有个仪式需要参加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva there's a ceremony that I have to attend this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.46,0:30:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为一位年轻艺术家为我画的肖像揭幕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The unveiling of my portrait by a young artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.80,0:30:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需去露个面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a brief appearance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.23,0:30:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我答应他会到场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I promised him that I'd be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你愿意照顾他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you come take care of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.92,0:30:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来了一个侍女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's a maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为了活来的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come about the job sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.39,0:31:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well come in then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.68,0:31:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么可以卖给我的 亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what have you got to sell me my dear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.62,0:31:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.26,0:31:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利利 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lillie sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.64,0:31:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 伊娃布莱克威尔女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe, Lady Eva Blackwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我突然想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It occurs to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.29,0:31:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有被邀请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I mightnot have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.14,0:31:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就去看展览 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}invited to this viewing Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.82,0:31:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不让我进怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if I'm not admitted huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.69,0:31:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.33,0:31:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生刚出去了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that Mr. Holmes just going out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.25,0:31:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也没有看清楚 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that I recognize Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.75,0:32:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们先生们 闲话不说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without more ado ladies and gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.17,0:32:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了它我们聚集在此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall perform the ceremony{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由我来主持这场仪式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for which we are gathered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得本人更温柔 更美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think she's gentler and more beautiful than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该坚持让惠斯勒为你作画{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should insist on Whistler painting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.23,0:33:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荣幸之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.23,0:33:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会很快离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to go soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.39,0:33:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男孩画笔下的你至臻至美 斯温斯特德女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy has caught you to perfection Lady Swinstead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.36,0:33:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没有被引荐过吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe we've been introduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.53,0:33:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯·奥古斯特·米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles Augustus Milverton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.59,0:33:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.95,0:33:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}借光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.32,0:34:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德女士 恕我冒昧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Swinstead, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.69,0:34:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的丈夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.57,0:34:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.84,0:34:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.15,0:34:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常漂亮的一位女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most beautiful lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.55,0:34:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.08,0:34:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Swinstead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder though{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.43,0:34:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是画对了她的嘴唇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if he's quite got her mouth right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.34,0:34:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失败啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.63,0:34:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识你吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:34:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.86,0:35:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为米尔沃顿工作 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You work for Milverton don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.77,0:35:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为他干活好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he good to work for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.31,0:35:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是没有那可恶的水管就还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would be if weren't for the bloody plumbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.19,0:35:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}水管？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Plumbing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.13,0:35:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远都漏水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always drippin off the spout{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.34,0:35:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it's always my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.03,0:35:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看你干了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.75,0:35:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这杯是我的 对吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That's my pint is it? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.74,0:35:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来亲个嘴儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now give us a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.97,0:35:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.95,0:35:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚开 罗伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.21,0:35:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们从没叫过水管工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We never sent for the plumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.74,0:35:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是斯托克斯叫我来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Stokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.96,0:35:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.71,0:36:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特 这是… 你叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert this is... what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.12,0:36:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Escott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我们一管到底"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We plumb the depths,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我公司的座右铭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's my firms motto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.79,0:36:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说是你叫来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says you sent for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.15,0:36:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那麻烦在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's the trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.64,0:36:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 我看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.34,0:36:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在问你这里发生了什么事情？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I asked you what's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.46,0:36:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是来修水管的 赫伯斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's come about the plumbing Mr. Hebworth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.58,0:36:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自作主张叫他来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I took the liberty of asking him to come and look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.29,0:36:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗 阿吉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't I Aggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.42,0:36:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有自作主张的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have no right to take liberties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.89,0:36:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里归我管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in charge here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我们得修好它 赫伯斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we do need it done Mr. Hebworth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.01,0:36:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说 米尔沃顿先生昨天还在说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, Mr. Milverton was only saying yesterday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.14,0:36:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管子里传出一股很难闻的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that there was a very, ugly smell coming from the piping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.68,0:36:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.18,0:37:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就继续吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carry on then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他早出晚归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He came in late and went out early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.83,0:37:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.89,0:37:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真遗憾啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shame isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个优秀的政治家 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a fine statesmen Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.10,0:37:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说 他的交际手腕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was his diplomacy, I'm told,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.57,0:37:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在几年前那段非常时期里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which eased Anglo-French relationships{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.90,0:37:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缓和了美国和法国之间的紧张关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at a most delicate time some year's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.96,0:37:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的遗孀听到这心碎的消息时 我也在场呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To think that I was there with his widow when the news was broken to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.07,0:37:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.92,0:37:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和他聊了几句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I exchanged a word with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.56,0:37:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一副充满算计 虚情假意的笑容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A more calculatingly insincere smile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.32,0:37:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望再也不要看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never hope to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.37,0:37:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯·奥古斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles Augustus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.84,0:37:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说他是一名艺术领域的鉴赏家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And described to me as a connoisseur in art matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.16,0:38:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个商人 只要他出马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A businessman who can make or raise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.24,0:38:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能让任何一名艺术家发家致富{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the fortune's of any artist to whom he devotes himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.59,0:38:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知廉耻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stems of hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.92,0:38:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是许多伦敦俱乐部里的会员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a member of a number of London clubs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.89,0:38:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我猜测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the basis I suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.15,0:38:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些人并不和他唱反调{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that there are those who do not oppose him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.32,0:38:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但第欧根尼俱乐部不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the Diogenes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.37,0:38:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听我的哥哥迈克罗夫特说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard my brother Microft{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.11,0:38:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自己找上门来 结果碰了一鼻子灰走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he presented himself and was turned away with a flea in his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.52,0:38:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的这位绅士敲诈犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're gentleman blackmailer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.01,0:38:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出生在巴伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was born in Balum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.18,0:38:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个磨工和他妻子的独子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only son of a glazer and his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.75,0:38:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从哪儿听说的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your source of information?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.74,0:38:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很多地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh a variety of sources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.72,0:38:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我用了你的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I applied your methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.12,0:38:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你乔装成了谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How have you faired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.14,0:38:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我进入了堡垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've entered the fortress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.26,0:38:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个生意兴隆的水管工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a plumber of a rising business,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.14,0:38:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}化名埃斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Escott's my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.09,0:38:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男管家名叫赫伯斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The butler, who goes under the name of Hebworth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.04,0:38:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是别人 正是那个男仆维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is none other than Veitch the footman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.82,0:38:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脸上中了枪 我敢肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who was shot in the face. I'm certain of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.89,0:39:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许米尔沃顿之所以雇了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps he was employed by Milverton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.78,0:39:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是作为他在克罗夫特丑闻事件中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a reward for keeping his silence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.83,0:39:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保持沉默的奖励{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}during the Kroft scandal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的管道被空气堵塞了  赫伯斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got air compression in your cell pipes Mr. Hebworth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才让这房子里一股臭味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the cause of the evil smell in this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些在下面接水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What this warrants is a save all below it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脏水就不会淤积了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so the dirty water don't get clogged up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.90,0:39:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the devil are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个水管工 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the plumber sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这屋子里不需要水管工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no need of a plumber in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.25,0:39:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.80,0:40:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是主人的特别房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is masters special room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.36,0:40:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在就出去 你这蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you stay out now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.21,0:40:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿吉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}待会儿见 是我的水管工来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll see you later it's my plumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿吉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.92,0:40:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不在乎是不是让他吃醋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't care if I do make him jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的主意…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His ideas are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.93,0:40:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢你的主人 阿吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't like your master Aggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.05,0:40:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得他不像个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he's a shady character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.79,0:40:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your right he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.56,0:41:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.99,0:41:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lillie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.80,0:41:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不会为了那活过来做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She won't come here for that Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.55,0:41:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她干嘛想到这里来做呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would she want to work here for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.13,0:41:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她才是个真正的侍女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was a real lady's maid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.19,0:41:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从她的穿着你就能看出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you could tell by her clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.74,0:41:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她是为了什么来呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was she after then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.10,0:41:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得你有点太好奇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you're getting to a bit too curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.05,0:41:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.12,0:41:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得好冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm getting cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.86,0:41:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Snuggling good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.31,0:42:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就亲一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.85,0:42:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.49,0:42:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小可怜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.40,0:42:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.62,0:42:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有了个主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.89,0:42:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个我们可以把米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A way in which we bring this fellow Milverton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.01,0:42:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绳之以法的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within the grasp of the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.98,0:42:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我们能引诱他去敲诈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we could tempt him to blackmail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.76,0:42:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个无辜的人 我们就能抓住他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an innocent person we should have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.27,0:42:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在假设…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now suppose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.91,0:42:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收到了一些不体面的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}suppose I was to be the recipient of some indiscreet letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你吗 华生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.60,0:42:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那谁写这些信呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who would prey write these letters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.71,0:42:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某个我们的熟人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone of our acquaintance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你身为一个水管工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you and your plumbing persona{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.45,0:42:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以把它们拿去卖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could offer them for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.57,0:42:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而在交易的过程中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And at the moment of transaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.69,0:42:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德就可以随时逮捕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lastrade would be on hand to arrest him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.76,0:43:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是法律上说 我们无法行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But legally we cannot move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.55,0:43:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到某个被害人准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until some victim is prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.43,0:43:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牺牲自己的名声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to sacrifice their reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.51,0:43:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跑去警察局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by going to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.92,0:43:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定有什么办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There must be some way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.21,0:43:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以让我们打倒这个恶魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we can fight this devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.46,0:43:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.06,0:43:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.08,0:43:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在过不到三个星期 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a mere three weeks, my love,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.88,0:43:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这将都是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this all will be yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.94,0:43:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我觉得配不上 - 胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I feel unworthy of it. - Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.68,0:43:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那世上就没有女人能配得上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no woman on earth more worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.44,0:43:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得不舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel unwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.84,0:43:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你在牵挂什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what it is your feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.70,0:43:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你的叔叔查尔斯 我理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's your Uncle Charles, I do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.94,0:43:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会先安排后事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have our future ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.69,0:43:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我们共度余生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have each other for the rest of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.30,0:44:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能在哪里找到维特农先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where can I find Monsieur Vetron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.92,0:44:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.27,0:44:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good evening monsieur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.61,0:44:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你瞧我正努力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see I've tried to bring{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.28,0:44:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想把一点巴黎的风情带到伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a little bit of Paris to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.72,0:44:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡米尔的手法很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Camille's method is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.54,0:44:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡米尔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Camille?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.69,0:45:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C-A-M… C.A.M.{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C-A-M, C.A.M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.30,0:45:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你知道吗 有时候你真让我惊叹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson you know sometimes you absolutely amaze me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.98,0:45:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他希望被人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He allows it to be known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.69,0:45:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他准备好了出一大笔钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he is prepared to pay very high sums{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.05,0:45:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买那些尊贵富有 地位显赫的人的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for letters, which come from wise people of wealth and position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.30,0:45:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你收到过…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you receive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.21,0:45:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收到过来自男仆或者侍女的信吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you receive these letters from valets and maids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.19,0:45:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不只他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not only them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候… 怎么说…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sometimes, how do you say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.01,0:45:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还从异教徒的恶棍手里得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}gentile ruffian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.82,0:45:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们从爱上他们 容易轻信的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who have the confidence and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.03,0:45:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那里得到那些秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}affection of trusting women?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.44,0:45:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁也不知道卡米尔的魔爪会伸向谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one knows where Camille's grip may fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.99,0:45:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是他的代理 他的执事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are his agent, his conductor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.71,0:45:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.42,0:45:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 我们只是很早之前有过交情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no, we go back a number of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.55,0:45:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很少有人会这么蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rarely people are stupid enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去相信他们的下人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to trust their servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.85,0:45:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最近是不是给他介绍了一个女仆？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you help conduct a housemaid to him recently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.88,0:45:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么会有兴趣呢 先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what his your interest monsieur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.34,0:45:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个朋友 或许有些东西想要脱手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a friend who may have something to sell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.05,0:45:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.65,0:45:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.35,0:46:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我说说他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.16,0:46:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他需要知道流程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well he needs to know the procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.56,0:46:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事很棘手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The matter is delicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.44,0:46:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.83,0:46:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向来如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It always is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个私人医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a personal physician{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为朗德公爵和公爵夫人效力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the Duke and Duchess of Landish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.82,0:46:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}新来的这个女仆呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now this housemaid who came by recently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.33,0:46:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚她在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's here tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.59,0:46:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庆祝自己的生日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}celebrating her birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.98,0:46:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从现在起一年里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a year from now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.06,0:46:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会是个自由人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she'll be on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.91,0:46:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}代价呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At whose expense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.43,0:47:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃 布莱克威尔女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eva Blackwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.25,0:47:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与多佛考特伯爵订婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Engaged to the Earl of Dovercourt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.44,0:47:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说几个星期里就会结婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Said to be married within weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.30,0:47:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她必须受到我们的保护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She must submit herself to our care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.37,0:47:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事不宜迟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Somehow without delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.21,0:47:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么敢进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you come into this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.76,0:47:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么敢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.34,0:47:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.28,0:47:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发脾气可没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a show of temper will avail you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.31,0:47:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我付不了钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't pay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.17,0:47:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有钱付给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't the money to pay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.59,0:48:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我的信还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me back my letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.38,0:48:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.81,0:48:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放过我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ieave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.26,0:48:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定有不少地方 可以找到钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be resourceful in finding the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.74,0:48:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有有权有势的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have influential friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.48,0:48:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们肯定会来帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely they'll come to your aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.71,0:48:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 他们不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No they won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.53,0:48:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能对谁开口呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who can I tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.38,0:48:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not my concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.92,0:48:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小姐 是多佛考特伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl of Dovercourt my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.37,0:48:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别紧张 来的是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't fuss. Oh there's a good fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.48,0:48:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.77,0:48:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是米尔沃顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Mr. Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.50,0:48:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很荣幸能结识您 阁下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm honored to meet you my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.31,0:48:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what is your business here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.96,0:48:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.33,0:48:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要与这位爵爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we share with his lordship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.63,0:48:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分享一下我们的小秘密吗 伊娃小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our little secret Lady Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.75,0:48:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.33,0:49:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就如你所愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.86,0:49:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的名片 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My card sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.81,0:49:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.54,0:49:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见了 两位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day at you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.50,0:49:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stokes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.48,0:49:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几点了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.43,0:49:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四点过二十{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Twenty past four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.97,0:49:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要多久 埃斯科特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much longer Escott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.44,0:49:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您原谅我要说的话 赫伯斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well if you'll forgive me for saying so Mr. Hebworth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.41,0:49:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的管子已经坏得很严重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're plumbing's in the shocking stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.12,0:49:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没见过这么糟糕的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the worst I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.23,0:50:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再给你两天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two more days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.11,0:50:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you're out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚来见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and see me tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.16,0:50:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Aggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.02,0:50:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得到可靠消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have it under authority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.10,0:50:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她每个星期日下午从这里骑马经过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she rides this way every Sunday afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.88,0:50:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能认出她吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you recognize her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.83,0:50:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在杂志上见过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I've seen her likeness in a magazine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.10,0:50:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果她是和多佛考特在一起 或许能吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if she's with Dovercourt, I might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.76,0:50:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.96,0:51:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马童 勒住马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy get the horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.65,0:51:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.46,0:51:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的教母正好住在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her godmother lives just over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.58,0:51:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果移动是安全的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We could carry her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.41,0:51:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以带她过去 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if it's safe to lift her doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.54,0:51:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 没有受伤 只是晕倒而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. There's no injury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.72,0:51:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.25,0:51:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真对不起引来那么大的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm so sorry to be of so much trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.02,0:51:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你躺在原地别动 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lay where you are my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.66,0:51:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're in safe hands now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.58,0:52:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Swinstead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.11,0:52:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个英格兰都与您同哀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All England shares in your grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.36,0:52:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的同事 华生医生 正在为伊娃小姐治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My colleague, Doctor Watson, is attending Lady Eva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.71,0:52:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子 因为我丈夫的死心乱如麻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor child is very disturbed by the death of my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.59,0:52:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么大碍 斯温斯特德女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's nothing serious Lady Swinstead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.40,0:52:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我建议你让她休息一阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I would advise you to make her rest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.31,0:52:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让她自己的医生看看她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and get her own doctor to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.94,0:52:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.88,0:52:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.76,0:52:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许伊娃小姐需要我为她效劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May Lady Eva need my services{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.48,0:52:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请收下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.56,0:52:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是米尔沃顿让她摔下马的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Milverton who caused her fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.58,0:52:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她看见了他的马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She saw his carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.26,0:53:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让他的受害人精神紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He rings the nerves of his victims{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让自己原本就鼓鼓的钱包更鼓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to add to his already swollen moneybags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.28,0:53:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是伦敦最差劲的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is the worst man in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷鸡摸狗 诡计多端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seething, slithering and sly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.10,0:53:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道除了留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes is there nothing better we can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.27,0:53:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没有别的可做了吗 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than spend our time here Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.94,0:53:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么建议吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have any suggestions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.03,0:53:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他对质 讨个说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Confront him. Challenge him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.36,0:53:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先动脑子再动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The brain before the cudgel rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.45,0:53:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meanwhile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.98,0:53:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会故伎重演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just like him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.90,0:53:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不断勒索他的受害人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he'll squeeze his victims{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.39,0:53:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到把他们榨干为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}till he's drained them dry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们却不去阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we're doing nothing to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.45,0:53:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.20,0:53:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须吃饭 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must eat child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.51,0:54:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么让你烦恼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's troubling you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.04,0:54:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在等谁来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you expecting someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.76,0:54:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.82,0:54:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是在想我的婚事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just thinking about my wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.82,0:54:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在告诉我实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.19,0:54:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gotchya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.33,0:55:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这房子里的人几点上床 阿吉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What time do they go to bed in this house Aggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.99,0:55:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想知道这个干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want to know for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.08,0:55:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就可以知道什么时候来看你是安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I know when it's safe to visit you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.50,0:55:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以随时到墙边来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could always come in over the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.77,0:55:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用小卵石敲我的窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Throw pebbles at my window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.74,0:55:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪扇是你的窗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is your window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.83,0:55:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你娶了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll only tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.84,0:55:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就告诉你 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you marry me love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.55,0:55:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 阿吉 我不能 - 那我就不告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh Aggie I can't. - Then I wont tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.64,0:55:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你总是那么牙尖嘴利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have such a way with words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.99,0:55:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.96,0:55:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在最上面的角落里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm at the very, very top on the corner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.76,0:55:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而主人 他在下面一层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Master, he's a floor below{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.19,0:55:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他靠近花园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he's next to the garden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.08,0:55:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫伯斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Monsieur Hebworth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.34,0:55:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在一楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's on the ground floor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.01,0:55:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿过书房就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just across from the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.45,0:56:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刘易斯睡觉的时候 你来了也吵不醒他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lewis is sleeping don't you come wake him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.74,0:56:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仆人厅里一直流传这个笑话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a joke in the servant's hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.33,0:56:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他不睡楼上呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't he sleep upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.92,0:56:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为主人想让他看门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because the master wants him on guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.45,0:56:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怕夜贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's afraid of burglars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.76,0:56:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是夜贼吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you a burglar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.19,0:56:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被你打动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You touched my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.66,0:56:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会把你当成是我的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will make you a gift of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.04,0:56:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.98,0:57:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.05,0:57:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马克西米利安 谁让你出来的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maximilian, who let you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.56,0:57:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.36,0:57:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.57,0:57:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert, Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.38,0:57:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.64,0:57:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会抓住你的 埃斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll get you Escott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.15,0:58:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就在那拐角处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's just around the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.80,0:58:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么这么大吵大闹？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's this bloody racket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.51,0:58:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.33,0:58:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你会很有兴趣听到下面这个消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson you'll be interested to hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.49,0:58:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我订婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I'm engaged to be married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.62,0:58:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.18,0:58:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和米尔沃顿的女仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the Milverton's housemaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.50,0:58:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.61,0:58:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I needed information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.92,0:58:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你做得太过火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you've gone too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.60,0:58:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是必不得已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a most necessary step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.60,0:58:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和她一起散步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've walked with her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.62,0:58:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和她聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}talked with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.79,0:58:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天晓得谈了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}heaven knows talks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.61,0:58:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这女孩怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.03,0:59:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有办法 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't help it Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.12,0:59:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这种赌博下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One must play one's cards as best one can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.96,0:59:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须出好每一手牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when such a stake is on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.13,0:59:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 我很高兴告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However, I rejoice to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.97,0:59:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个讨厌的竞争对手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I have a hated rival{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.89,0:59:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我离开的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that will cut me out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.28,0:59:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会挤掉我的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the moment my back is turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.12,0:59:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是妙不可言的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a splendid day it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.39,0:59:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你喜欢这天气？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You like this weather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.71,0:59:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.73,0:59:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲在我十二岁的时候过世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father died when I was 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我母亲留在这个国家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My mother stays in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.91,0:59:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德阁下和夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord and Lady Swinstead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.48,0:59:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我在伦敦有家的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have made London home to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.04,0:59:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去年安排我参加了社交季{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but indeed they arranged my season last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.80,0:59:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我你的手套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me your gloves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.61,0:59:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Mrs. Hudson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.79,0:59:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这是在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.46,0:59:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个早上你都没有出门 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You haven't been out this morning Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.48,0:59:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不做一个侦探 也能看这位年轻女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you don't have to be a detective to see that this young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.58,1:00:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大病初愈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is recently up from a sick bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.77,1:00:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗 亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Isn't that so my dear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.62,1:00:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须让她的脸颊重现红润{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must put some roses back in those cheeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.79,1:00:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.97,1:00:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一碗热汤真是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The broth is an excellent idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.88,1:00:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 请离开一下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson will you vanish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.08,1:00:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说了离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said vanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.99,1:00:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我的初恋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was my first love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.29,1:00:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在斯德福克我们邻居家的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The son of some neighbors of ours in Suffick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.82,1:00:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我们门不当户不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we were ill matched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.88,1:00:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有什么前途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had few prospects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.94,1:00:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我来到伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I came down to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.13,1:00:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参加去年的社交季{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iast year for the season{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便和他分手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I broke off with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.13,1:00:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有意识到自己让他有多伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't realize how much I hurt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.83,1:00:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他退回了我的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He returned my letters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.02,1:00:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把它们放进了箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I put them away in a trunk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.55,1:00:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直保管着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I keep with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.93,1:01:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些信写了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now the substance of these letters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.02,1:01:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些蠢话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're just a little foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.69,1:01:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却足够引起你未婚夫的怀疑？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But sufficient to cause your fiance misgiving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.61,1:01:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈瑞如此为我骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Harry's so proud of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.75,1:01:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时我真害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It frightens me sometimes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.73,1:01:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果自己辜负了他的期望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I cannot live up to his expectation of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.41,1:01:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你的侍女发现的信吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it your maid who found these letters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.78,1:01:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是利利 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lillie yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.63,1:01:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trusted her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.46,1:01:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.69,1:01:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会这样背叛我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she could have betrayed me like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.10,1:01:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个 利利怎么会知道米尔沃顿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How would this Lillie know about Milverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.61,1:01:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想她之所以会想到这个主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think the idea may have come to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.16,1:01:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为之前发生在我朋友身上的不幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through a misfortune that befell a friend of mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.75,1:02:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛特 她原本要结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charlotte, who was to have married{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.43,1:02:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嫁给多金上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a Colonel Dorking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.72,1:02:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿先生给她寄去了些信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Mr. Milverton sent her some letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.56,1:02:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是些让人痛苦的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were very distressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.38,1:02:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当她收到信时 利利和我都在场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lillie and I were there when she received them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.33,1:02:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没想到同样的命运会降临到我身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To think the same fate has befallen me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.39,1:02:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都会过去的 伊娃小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be all right Lady Eva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.04,1:02:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能做什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What could you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.40,1:02:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的婚礼在18日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My marriage is on the 18th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.04,1:02:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他提出要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's demanding that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.37,1:02:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要在婚礼前四天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the money be paid to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.12,1:03:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是14日付钱给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}four days prior to the wedding on the 14th,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.70,1:03:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在舞会那天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the day of the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.51,1:03:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舞会？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.11,1:03:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多佛考特阁下安排了一次婚宴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Dovercourt has arranged a wedding feast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.59,1:03:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邀请了伦敦一半的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and invited half of London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.27,1:03:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我担心死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm dreading it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.19,1:03:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你愿意让我全权代理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you will place yourself in my hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.57,1:03:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会通知米尔沃顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll inform Mr. Milverton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.27,1:03:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你授权让我和他见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you've commissioned me to meet him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.08,1:03:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我尽量谈到最好的条件？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make the best terms that I can huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.76,1:03:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我积蓄有限 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have limited resources Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.67,1:03:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但足够我去和他讨价还价了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But enough for me to bargain with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.08,1:03:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能空着手去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot approach him empty handed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.51,1:03:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.12,1:03:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.78,1:03:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我向您的教母问好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My best wishes to your Godmother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.68,1:03:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.57,1:03:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须相信福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must trust Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.11,1:03:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.43,1:03:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全地信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.86,1:04:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太会送你出门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson will see you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.73,1:04:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位年轻女士 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That young lady, Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.47,1:04:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然得到了极大的关照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must be treated with infinite care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.01,1:04:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点都不像你最近其它的恶作剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unlike your other recent escapade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.38,1:04:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.15,1:04:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她能独自前来已经是鼓足了勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it took some nerve for her to come here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.84,1:04:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信伊娃小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is my belief that Lady Eva{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和米尔沃顿的侍女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the Milverton housemaid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有某个共同点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have something in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.71,1:04:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.03,1:04:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.91,1:04:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 活力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson juice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.56,1:04:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在面对逆境的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the face of adversity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.62,1:04:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 米尔沃顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Mr. Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.86,1:05:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唉呦 唉呦 唉呦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.34,1:05:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.31,1:05:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.41,1:05:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.15,1:05:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.96,1:05:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洛蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lottie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.82,1:06:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am so glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.88,1:06:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴黎不是答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Paris wasn't the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.01,1:06:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到你真不容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been hard to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.11,1:06:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What were you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.64,1:06:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fell asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.66,1:06:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰逊告诉了我你叔叔查尔斯的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Johnson told me about your Uncle Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.48,1:06:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我留在这里是为了安慰戴安娜 但是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stayed here to comfort Diana but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.42,1:06:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这房子太悲伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this house is so sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.85,1:06:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们6点半再登门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll call again at 6:30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.43,1:06:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}C.A.M\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C-A-M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.63,1:07:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.50,1:07:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.84,1:07:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.56,1:07:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位先生… 这样谨慎吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This gentlemen is it discreet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.76,1:07:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生是我的朋友和搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson is my friend and partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.40,1:08:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纯粹出于对你委托人利益的考虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is purely in the interest of your client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.01,1:08:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我表示反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I protest it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.21,1:08:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事很棘手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The matter is so very delicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生已经想到这点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson has already thought of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.11,1:08:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请允许我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.82,1:08:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.59,1:08:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们就来谈买卖吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we may proceed to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.38,1:08:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在你的留言里说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said in your note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.87,1:08:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是伊娃女士的全权代表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you are acting for the Lady Eva,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.49,1:08:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你有权接受我的条件吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are you empowered to accept my terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.78,1:08:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的条件是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are your terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.33,1:09:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}7000磅？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seven thousand pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.50,1:09:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一种选择呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the alternative?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.45,1:09:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.47,1:09:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}讨论这个我很不好受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is painful for me to discuss it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.28,1:09:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我可以说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I can say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.04,1:09:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是出于极为慎重的考量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that all of this is done with most careful consideration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.80,1:09:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果在14日那天没有付钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if the money is not paid on the 14th then there certainly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.05,1:09:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么18日那天也不会有什么婚礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be no marriage on the 18th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.16,1:09:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们当然熟悉那些信的内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are, of course, familiar with the contents of these letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.16,1:09:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会建议我们的委托人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall advise our client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.53,1:09:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把整个故事告诉她未来的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to tell her future husband the whole story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.90,1:09:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信他的宽宏大量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and trust to his generosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.58,1:09:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你显然是不了解伯爵的为人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well then you evidently do not know the Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.79,1:09:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些信里到底有什么能伤人的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What harm is there in these letters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.89,1:09:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遣词很活泼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are sprightly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.57,1:09:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常活泼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}very sprightly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.52,1:09:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士是位有文笔的写信人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lady was a charming correspondent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.95,1:09:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我向你保证多佛考特伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I assure you the Earl of Dovercourt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.18,1:09:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会欣赏它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will fail to appreciate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.34,1:09:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 如果你不这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However, if you think otherwise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.01,1:10:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不过是桩生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's purely a matter of business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.51,1:10:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你认为这对你的委托人是最好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you think it in the best interests of your client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.78,1:10:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那掏出那么一大笔钱的确太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then it would indeed be foolish to pay so large a sum of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.36,1:10:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说得太快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You go too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.87,1:10:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这么一件棘手的事上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We would certainly make every effort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.01,1:10:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们当然是要尽力避免丑闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to avoid scandal in so delicate a matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.88,1:10:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定你也是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt sure that you see it in that light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.15,1:10:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.18,1:10:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃小姐不是个富有的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eva is not a wealthy woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}2000英镑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two thousand pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.59,1:10:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她所有的积蓄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would be total drain on her resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.76,1:10:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的那个数字她完全负担不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sum you named utterly beyond her power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.77,1:10:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们以这个价钱赎回信吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return the letters at the price we indicate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.00,1:10:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.53,1:10:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你能拿到的最高价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is the highest you can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.69,1:10:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说那是小姐的所有积蓄也许是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What you say maybe true of the lady's resources{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.75,1:10:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是一旦结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the surely the occasion of her marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.47,1:11:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不正是她的朋友和亲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is it not a proper time for her friends and relations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.13,1:11:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}助她一臂之力的时候吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make some little effort on her behalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.65,1:11:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们可能正犹豫送什么结婚礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They may hesitate as to an acceptable wedding present{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.38,1:11:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这一扎信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but this little bundle of letters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.55,1:11:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带了的余兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would bring more joy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.12,1:11:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将远多于伦敦所有的宴会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than all the candelabras and butter dishes in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.14,1:11:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wouldn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.48,1:11:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.74,1:11:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh dear me then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.20,1:11:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是不幸啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How very unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.91,1:11:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得小姐们都被糟糕地建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot help feeling that ladies are ill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.87,1:11:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要去做什么尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}advised in not making an effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.90,1:11:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.69,1:11:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个属于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This belongs to,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.36,1:11:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许不该告诉你们这是属于谁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well perhaps it's hardly fair to tell you to whom it belongs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.30,1:11:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到明天早上它们到女士的丈夫手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until tomorrow morning when it will be in the hands of the lady's husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.67,1:12:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是因为她筹不到这么一点小钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all because she will not find a beggarly sum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.50,1:12:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原本是很容易办到的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which she could easily do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.62,1:12:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要把她的一些钻石换成人工珠宝的就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}simply by turning some of her diamonds into paste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.06,1:12:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多么可惜啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is such a pity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.05,1:12:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你或许在最近的晨报上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may have noticed a small paragraph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.17,1:12:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}注意到一篇短讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}recently in the Morning Post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.16,1:12:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尊贵的迈尔斯小姐和多金上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sudden end of the engagement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.73,1:12:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突然终止了彼此的婚约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between the Honorable Miss Miles and Colonel Dorking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.21,1:12:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 真是个不幸的结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes and it's tragic consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.55,1:12:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也可以把它称为谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can almost call it murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.49,1:12:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么回应此事呢 米尔沃顿先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you answer for that Mr. Milverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.46,1:12:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那种情形下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How a man conducts himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.34,1:12:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个人做出怎样的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under such circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.18,1:12:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是他自己的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is a matter for himself alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.35,1:12:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是不义之财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a monstrous accession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.37,1:12:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.76,1:12:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一个人害死了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you alone who caused his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.30,1:12:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就为了那点钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the sum involved niggardly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.88,1:12:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实才1200磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed a mere twelve hundred pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.66,1:12:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就可以解决所有的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would have settled the whole questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.40,1:12:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可惜 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pitiful isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.29,1:12:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我发现福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet I find you Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.41,1:12:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为一个明白人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a man of sense,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.63,1:12:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居然拿你们委托人全部未来和荣耀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}boggling over terms when the whole future and honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.29,1:13:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我谈条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of your client is at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.79,1:13:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你让我很吃惊 真的很吃惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You surprise me. You do really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.86,1:13:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找不到那么多钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The money cannot be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.92,1:13:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好你接受我们提出的价钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely it would be better for you to take the substantial sum we offer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.95,1:13:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是毁了她的前程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than to ruin this young woman's career,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.16,1:13:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然什么也得不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which can profit you in no way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.17,1:13:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你就错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you're mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.92,1:13:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曝光此事会间接使我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An exposure would profit me indirectly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.68,1:13:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受到很大的益处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a considerable degree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.87,1:13:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还有八件 十件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have eight or ten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.89,1:13:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}类似的事情要去谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}similar cases materializing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.02,1:13:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是伊娃小姐的不幸能成为事例流传开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it is circulated that I have made a severe example of Lady Eva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.62,1:13:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会使其余的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll shall find the rest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.50,1:13:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更理智一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much more open to reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.55,1:13:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们明白我的意思了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you see my point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.28,1:13:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来看看这些信的内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see the contents of those letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.28,1:14:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.68,1:14:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我以为你会做些有创意的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes I've been expecting you to do something original.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.71,1:14:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这早就司空见惯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This has been tried so often before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.27,1:14:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小爱德华 克罗夫特就是其中一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Young Edward Kroft for one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.17,1:14:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克罗夫特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kroft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.42,1:14:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个男仆维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The footman Veitch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.65,1:14:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}替你挡下了本该射向你的子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who took the bullet that was rightfully yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.22,1:14:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你调查过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've done some work on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.35,1:14:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你一定知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you must know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.62,1:14:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么能靠近伤害我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that nothing ever came of an attack on my person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.73,1:14:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我武装到了牙齿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm armed to the teeth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at all times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.11,1:14:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无时无刻不准备着使用武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm perfectly prepared to use my weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.58,1:14:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道法律会保护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and knowing that the law will support me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.94,1:14:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你或许有机会来检验一下这套理论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may well have your chance to test your assumption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.72,1:14:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 别让人来打扰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson I am not to be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.36,1:14:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.65,1:15:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你不会真认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes surely you don't believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.66,1:15:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会傻到把谋生的东西随身携带吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd be so foolish to carry my livelihood here in my pocket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.36,1:15:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是为了确认一下 米尔沃顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just making sure Mr. Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.96,1:15:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 现在 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well now gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.46,1:15:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今晚还有一两个小约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have one or two little interviews this evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这到汉普斯特德还很远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it's a long drive to Hampstead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.41,1:15:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人给了米尔沃顿一点教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now someone has dealt Milverton a blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.12,1:15:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个愤怒的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An outraged husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.08,1:16:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和其余在这个灰暗的城市里数以千计人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just as there are thousands in this grey city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.63,1:16:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盼着米尔沃顿去死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who crave Milverton's destruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.24,1:16:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许会先我们一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and may yet beat us to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.41,1:16:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.39,1:16:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和任何人一样爱好艺术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm as fond of art as any man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.32,1:16:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你不认为在昨天的谈话之后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but don't you think after yesterday's encounter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.99,1:16:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艺术离不开头脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Art is bond to the brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.68,1:16:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别是在做决定的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}especially in moments of decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.34,1:16:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们了解了一些米尔沃顿的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we've learned something about Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.01,1:16:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的残忍无情很难被曝光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That he's ruthless is hardly a revelation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.22,1:16:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的虚荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that of his vanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.61,1:16:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他的弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to a certain his vulnerability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.66,1:16:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被砍坏的马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can see that the damage to his carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.32,1:16:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许让他有些不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}might have unsettled him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.03,1:16:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一定要利用这些事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must exploit such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.50,1:16:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肆无忌惮的蓄意破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wanton vandalism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.91,1:16:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"盔甲上出现了裂缝"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any chink in the armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.06,1:16:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.91,1:16:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this is my friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.51,1:16:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尊敬的夏洛特 迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Honorable Charlotte Miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.42,1:16:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这为是夏洛克福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.71,1:17:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他的搭档华生先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his partner Mr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.86,1:17:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃小姐能和您单独谈谈吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Eva may speak privately to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.76,1:17:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈尔斯太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Miles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.71,1:17:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请接受我们的慰问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}please accept our sympathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.39,1:17:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生和我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.99,1:17:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都知道您的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are fully aware of your situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.97,1:17:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很感谢你 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is most kind of you Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.82,1:17:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但人要带着自己的错误活下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but one has to live with one's mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不肯让步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was unyielding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.14,1:17:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 下一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now the next move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.33,1:17:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要你完全的配合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}requires your delicate cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.60,1:17:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会按你说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll do anything you say Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.10,1:17:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舞会在哪天？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dance in your honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.29,1:17:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}14号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the 14th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.82,1:17:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好 斯托克斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good afternoon Mr. Stokes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.76,1:18:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说过别让人打扰我 姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you I was not to be disturbed girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.47,1:18:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.38,1:18:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Mr. Sherlock Holmes to see you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.42,1:18:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"阿吉 我被你打动了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Oh Aggie, you've touched my heart."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.91,1:18:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.12,1:18:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来通知你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here to inform you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.41,1:18:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的委托人已经接受了你的条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that my client accepts your terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.85,1:18:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的做法是明智的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's acted with perspicacity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.58,1:18:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有个小小的请求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She begs but a small favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.84,1:18:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.20,1:18:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她想把交易延迟到15号进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the exchange be delayed until the 15th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.25,1:18:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在它前一天晚上 伯爵安排了一个舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Earl has arranged a dance for the previous night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.86,1:18:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她需要专注于那事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she is somewhat preoccupied with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.20,1:18:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舞会 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dance yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.39,1:18:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那第二天的10点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So 10 o'clock the following morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.94,1:18:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们交易 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we can do business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.99,1:18:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}7000英镑？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seven thousand pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.24,1:18:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.95,1:18:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这还是在贝克街？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here or at Baker's Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.15,1:18:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里或贝克街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here, Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.61,1:18:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许找一个中立的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neutral ground perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.47,1:18:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第欧根尼俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Diogenes club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.52,1:19:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是它的会员吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are a member?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.77,1:19:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.97,1:19:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我这种突然的转变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me this sudden turnabout{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.17,1:19:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你的建议吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was it on your advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.20,1:19:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能让我的委托人听天由命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not abandon my client to her fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.30,1:19:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿先生 你胜利了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Milverton. You are the victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.92,1:19:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是天赐的芳香{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a divine fragrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.92,1:19:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去世的丈夫和我 就是她第二个家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My late husband and I were something of a second family to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.61,1:19:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以你明白我的忧虑了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so you see my concern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.99,1:19:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个勒索她的人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man who is blackmailing her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.74,1:19:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯·奥古斯特·米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles Augustus Milverton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.25,1:19:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个画商{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's an arts dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.79,1:19:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.21,1:19:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.44,1:19:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他收集流言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's well placed to hear the gossip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.35,1:19:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后作恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and do his worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.07,1:20:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生怎么想？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What view does Mr. Holmes take of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.50,1:20:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自有主张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I'm sure he has something in mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.54,1:20:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他经常是最后才让我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he seldom confides in me till the last minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.91,1:20:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.21,1:20:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德女士很关心这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Swinstead is fully primed for the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.29,1:20:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时间快没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time is running out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.22,1:20:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.86,1:20:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是钱有问题…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it is a question of paying the money...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.75,1:20:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那没必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will not be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.52,1:20:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你能保证了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can give assurance then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.03,1:20:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说可能有点轻率 斯温斯特德夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be unwise in me Lady Swinstead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.99,1:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我向您保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.87,1:20:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会尽我所能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will give it my best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.07,1:20:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那样我会很满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall have to be satisfied with that then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.83,1:20:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.76,1:20:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个人一定要闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man must be silenced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.33,1:21:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她知道米尔沃顿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does she know about Milverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.18,1:21:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的名字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.50,1:21:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的  我告诉她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I told her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.48,1:21:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我错了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was that wrong of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.83,1:21:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这些钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Watson these bills,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.20,1:21:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须要付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they must be paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.18,1:21:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 我确保了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, incidentally I managed to secure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.92,1:21:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都被邀请去参见多佛考特的舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an invitation for us both to the Dovercourt dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.88,1:21:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然离伦敦有点远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The house is some miles from London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.38,1:21:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是离我的目标近了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in reach for my purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.14,1:21:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么目标？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What purposes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.70,1:21:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要在那天晚上 潜入米尔沃顿家偷窃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intend to burgle the Milverton house that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.20,1:21:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For heaven sakes Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.70,1:21:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}think what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们好好地想清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well let us look at it fairly and clearly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.58,1:21:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.97,1:21:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事从道义上来说是正义的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the cause is morally justifiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.34,1:21:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.42,1:21:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在法律上是犯罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Technically criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.54,1:22:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过是像抢他的钱包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No more than raiding his pockets ,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.12,1:22:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那时就愿意帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a cause which you were perfectly willing to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时事出突然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was on the spurt of the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.51,1:22:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是理智的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not on the coal light of reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.87,1:22:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理智？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.28,1:22:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事里有"理智"的用武之地吗 华生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there reasoning to be done Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.13,1:22:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有一样要我动脑子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing to test my brain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.56,1:22:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the curse of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.16,1:22:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.63,1:22:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你被抓了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you're caught,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.71,1:22:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这份令人尊敬的事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an honored career{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.31,1:22:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会彻底完蛋 在公众前颜面丢尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ending in failure and public disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.58,1:22:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么完蛋 什么丢脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What failure? What disgrace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.71,1:22:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能比得上被打败？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Against defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.51,1:22:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你再了解我不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know me well enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.63,1:22:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有别的可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I would never adopt so objectionable a course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.25,1:22:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是不会出此下策{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if another were possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.81,1:22:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须拿到那些信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must have those letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.97,1:22:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对那房子了如指掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And have the house in the palm of my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.07,1:22:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先动手再动脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cudgel before the brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.50,1:22:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那讨厌的米尔沃顿呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the odious Milverton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.38,1:22:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道他会敞开大门请你大摇大摆进去吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think he's just going to open his gates and invite you to stroll in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.85,1:22:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿会去舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton will be at the dance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.75,1:23:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为伊娃小姐的客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the guest of Lady Eva's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.32,1:23:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太荒谬了 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's monstrous Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.49,1:23:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我赌上了自尊和名誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My self-respect and reputation are at stake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.03,1:23:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是唯一的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.97,1:23:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I don't like it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.51,1:23:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.16,1:23:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么可怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.84,1:23:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊娃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.84,1:23:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太  谁让你给我整理的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson why did you tidy for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.84,1:24:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的鞋呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the hell are my shoes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.17,1:24:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鞋？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shoes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.29,1:24:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.16,1:24:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面具？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Masks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.38,1:24:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑丝手绢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Black silk handkerchief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.73,1:24:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看你天生就会这些事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see you have a natural turn for this sort of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.97,1:24:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也很纳闷自己怎么学来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder where I learned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.07,1:24:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚要像平时一样小心提防{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take the usual precautions tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.80,1:24:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫伯斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hebworth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.55,1:24:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.91,1:25:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝您愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enjoy your evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.97,1:26:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这儿的人都有危险 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The people are at risks here Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.64,1:26:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.83,1:26:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们8分钟后走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We leave in eight minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.04,1:26:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打扰一下 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.40,1:26:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人在楼上想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her ladyship would like to see you upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.72,1:26:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.47,1:26:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.92,1:26:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是被邀请的客人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is he an invited guest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.70,1:27:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.03,1:27:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是伊娃的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes it's something Eva schemed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.43,1:27:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那副画{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The painting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.93,1:27:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}聪明的姑娘很可能 是想压低价钱才邀请他来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The old girl is probably trying to whittle down the price by inviting him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.04,1:27:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别担心 戴安娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't worry yourself Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.41,1:27:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.86,1:27:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How strange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.48,1:28:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这看见你 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see you here Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.16,1:28:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生意娱乐两不误？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mixing business with pleasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.18,1:28:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问你也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no doubt you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.11,1:28:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今晚是纯粹来玩的 福尔摩斯 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Purely pleasure this evening Mr. Holmes I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.15,1:28:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会遵守我们的约定吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be keeping our appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.06,1:29:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.32,1:29:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的访客半小时到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am expecting a visitor in an half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.97,1:29:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.38,1:30:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主人走了 仆人就开始享乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Servants are playing while the master's away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.21,1:31:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.36,1:31:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米尔沃顿的马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Milverton's carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.17,1:31:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没时间关门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no time to lose the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.77,1:35:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你使我缩短了今晚的娱乐时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You made me curtail my evening's entertainment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.76,1:35:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你证明那是值得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope you prove worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.23,1:35:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能挑个更适合交谈的时间来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You couldn't have come at a more sociable time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.32,1:35:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 不行就算了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well if you couldn't, you couldn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.43,1:35:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是伯爵夫人是个严厉的女主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if the Countess is a hard mistress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.87,1:36:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在有机会报复她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have a chance now to get even with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.67,1:36:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑  你怎么在发抖？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bless the girl, what are you shivering about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.73,1:36:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.31,1:36:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打起精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull yourself together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.50,1:36:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来谈生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now then, let's get down to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.89,1:36:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说你有5封{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You save you have five letters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.87,1:36:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于D·阿尔伯特伯爵夫人的信？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which compromise the Countess D' Albert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.56,1:36:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要卖 我要买{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to sell them. I want to buy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.97,1:36:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前为止一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So far, so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.50,1:36:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就剩下谈好价钱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it remains to fix the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.59,1:36:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我要先检查这些信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I shall want to examine the letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.41,1:36:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果内容够好…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they prove to be good specimens then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.62,1:37:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 是你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great heavens, it is you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.05,1:37:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个被你毁了一生的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A woman who's life you have ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.29,1:37:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你太固执了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were so very obstinate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.46,1:37:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}12年前 巴黎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Paris twelve years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.13,1:37:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你要把我逼上绝路呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you drive me to such extremities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.29,1:37:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一段被尘封的往事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An episode long closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.15,1:37:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本连一个苍蝇都不愿伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't hurt a fly of my own accord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.48,1:37:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You waited for the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.22,1:37:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到能赢得最大的赌注的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when the stakes was most worth winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.62,1:37:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was I to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.81,1:37:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我出的价钱你完全能负担{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I put the price well within your means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.41,1:37:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把信给我丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Instead you sent the letters to my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.65,1:37:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你没有付钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would not pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.45,1:37:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个我连为他系鞋都配不上的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man whose boots I was never worthy to lace-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.13,1:37:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你伤了他高贵的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you broke his gallant heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.49,1:37:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}vial creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.22,1:37:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天我来求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That day I came here I prayed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.56,1:38:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发发善心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begged you for mercy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.05,1:38:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你却当面嘲弄我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you laughed in my face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.08,1:38:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你现在这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you are trying to laugh now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.99,1:38:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你懦弱的内心 使你的嘴唇不住地颤动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your coward heart cannot keep you lips from twitching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.64,1:38:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别以为你能吓到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't imagine that you can bully me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.01,1:38:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只要提高声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm only to raise my voice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.97,1:38:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会再伤害别人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will ruin no more lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.33,1:38:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以叫来我的仆人 逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can call my servantsand have you arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.10,1:38:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你再也不能像折磨我这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will wring no more hearts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.78,1:38:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}折磨别人了 查尔斯 米尔沃顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you have wrung mine Charles Milverton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.11,1:38:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以容忍你对我发火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will make allowance for your natural anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.05,1:38:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你马上离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave the room at once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.00,1:38:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就什么也不说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'll say no more about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.51,1:38:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要替天行道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will free the world of a poisonous thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.73,1:38:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've done me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.74,1:40:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放火里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.68,1:40:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯温斯特德夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Swinstead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.61,1:40:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.44,1:40:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.69,1:40:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.22,1:41:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.06,1:41:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要拍卖的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the sale of the property{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.49,1:41:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已故查尔斯·A·米尔沃顿的物品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Charles A. Milverton described, deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.99,1:41:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lot one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.38,1:41:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一盒子杂物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a box of miscellaneous objects,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.30,1:41:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小饰品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trinkets,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.55,1:41:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}correspondence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.19,1:41:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}5磅？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do hear five pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.15,1:41:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.42,1:41:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维特农家政的斯图尔特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The stuart from the Vetron household{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.74,1:41:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}making sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.85,1:41:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lot two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.63,1:41:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雅典娜的半身像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bust of Athena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.92,1:41:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}古代智慧 工业 和战争的女神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ancient Goddess of wisdom, industry and war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.26,1:42:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人愿意为这尊大理石像出价吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now what do I have for this fine marble statue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.97,1:42:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}10磅？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ten pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.85,1:42:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人出20磅？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Twenty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.94,1:42:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}20磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Twenty pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.33,1:42:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人出30磅吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thirty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.11,1:42:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}30磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have thirty pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.03,1:42:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}50磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fifty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.25,1:42:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}50磅了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have fifty pounds sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.93,1:42:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人出60磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sixty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.86,1:42:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人出80磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eighty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.98,1:42:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}80磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eighty pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.14,1:42:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人出90磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ninety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.78,1:42:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位先生出了90磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ninety pounds against you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.69,1:42:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}90磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At ninety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.13,1:42:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}100磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One hundred pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.12,1:42:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有更高的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.26,1:42:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卖给那边的先生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sold to the gentleman over there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.93,1:42:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以100磅的价钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for one hundred pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.93,1:42:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.57,1:43:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从拍卖会上买的 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bought it in an auction Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.04,1:43:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}花了100磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It cost a hundred pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.58,1:43:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为什么要砸碎它呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why has he smashed it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.51,1:43:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为里面有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought there might be something in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.16,1:43:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴我错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm more than happy to say that I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.12,1:43:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Hudson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.84,1:43:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 那个法国人为什么还要它？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why is a point of interest Holmes did the Frenchman want it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.04,1:43:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感情用事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sentimental reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.39,1:43:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是想确认一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just making sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.39,1:44:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别写了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.58,1:44:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些地方我都觉得不光彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are certain aspects in which I am not proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.48,1:44:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.99,1:44:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这个故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bury this case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.97,1:44:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏在你的兜里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}deep in your pocket.{\r}
